@startuml overview
title Wake-up run
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Waiting
Waiting : wake time = earlier of\n(first event - lead time, alarm setting)
Waiting --> Ringing : wake time
Ringing --> Briefing : alarm sound length elapsed,\nor judged awake in the first round
Briefing --> Interval : briefing done, judged asleep
Interval --> Ringing : judged asleep after interval\n(louder, up to the limit)
Briefing --> Watching : judged awake\n(the first briefing is read to the end)
Ringing --> Watching : judged awake in a snooze round
Interval --> Watching : judged awake
Watching : back-to-bed window (default 30 min)
Watching --> Ringing : judged asleep\n(louder than before)
Watching --> [*] : back-to-bed window elapsed

note bottom of Watching
  Judged asleep and judged awake
  come from the bed state (PS-BED-008):
  asleep after 5 min in bed (default),
  awake as soon as out of bed.
end note
@enduml
